\dThe Gero Hot Springs are good enough for you. The next\nday, you can climb Mt. Otake and spend the night at\nOsamu's family home. On the third day, you can go\nsightseeing in Nagoya and sleep over at Himeo's.\d%K%P
「下吕温泉就够了。\n第二天登御岳，在理君的老家住两宿。\n第三天就观光名古屋，住姬绪姐家」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
