Our ceremony was planned for next spring.%K%P
婚礼在明年春天举行。%K%P
To anyone not in the know, Toko -- who finally\nacknowledged me as her father -- probably looked like a\nstereotypical girl not too thrilled about her single\nparent remarrying.%K%P
现在都子虽能堂堂正正地承认我这个父亲，\n但客观上，最喜欢的父亲的再婚并不是趣事，\n看起来就像是我带来的女儿对新妈妈顶嘴的样子吧。%K%P
...In a way, that was both flattering and embarrassing.%K%P
…如果真是如此，那还真令人羞愧啊。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOkay, look. Just let me say ahead of time that this has\nnothing to do with Osamu, and I'm only warning you as your\nformer homeroom teacher.\d%K%P
「我说啊，这件事，和理没关系，\n而是作为你的原班主任给你的忠告哦？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat premise is meaningless. If it had nothing to do with\nOsamu, I wouldn't have a problem with someone like you to\nbegin with.\d%K%P
「不觉得前提是没有意义的嘛。\n如果和理君没关系，我也就不会对老师之类的人顶嘴了」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dWhat do you mean, someone like me?!\nI'm genuinely worried about your future here!\d%K%P
「把人家说成『之类的』是什么意思！\n明明我是真心担心着你的将来的！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou don't have to worry about me. I'll study lots and\nlots, graduate university, and make my debut in society as\na woman far superior to you in every aspect.\d%K%P
「用不着老师您担心～，\n我会更加更加认真学习，上大学，步入社会，\n会成为您所无法企及的优秀女人～」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIf you're that confident, then try getting into the same\nuniversity as Osamu and me. Let me warn you, though: your\nShuusen University is not even in the same league.\d%K%P
「既然你都这么说了，那就考上我和理所读的大学试试看啊。\n话先说在前头，那可不是秋泉大这种级别的学校能比的哦～」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI hate it when adults look down on the younger\ngeneration. At least Osamu never does anything that\ndisgusting.\d%K%P
「最讨厌您这种瞧不起人的成年人态度了。\n至少理君是不会像你这样说话的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dDo you realize you're becoming more and more of a spoiled\nbrat precisely because Osamu pampers you all the time?\nThat's no way to grow up!\d%K%P
「就是因为理太宠着你，\n你越来越任性，自制力也越来越差，\n变成与自身年龄相符的孩子了，这些你意识到了吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu said he likes me better this way.\nHe said he'd keep loving me forever and ever.\d%K%P
「理君说过他更喜欢现在这样的我嘛。\n还说他会一直一直疼爱我的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI'm the only one whom Osamu loves as a woman!\nI receive different treatment compared to a kid like you!\d%K%P
「理只会把我当作女人来爱！\n和孩子的你，对待方式是不一样的！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI dunno, from how emotional you've gotten, I can only\nguess you're not actually as confident as your act makes\nit look.\d%K%P
「如此激动地说话，\n正是您对自己没有信心的体现嘛～」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI can't believe she said that!\nJust how much of a sore loser can one child be?!\d%K%P
「还真敢说出来啊这孩子！\n一直一直一直都不死心」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI lost by, like, a sliver! You better not let down your\nguard, or I might just steal him back!\d%K%P
