%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAh, in that case, I know a good Italian restaurant\nnearby. They charge almost ten thousand yen per dinner,\nbut you can have a good lunch by spending only a\nthousand.\d%K%P
「啊～，那么，\n我知道附近有一家不错的意大利饭店哦。\n晚上会收将近一万，但中午只收一千日元」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat sounds great! In that case, though, I'll make dinner\ntonight. We gotta make sure Osamu gets proper nutrition.\d%K%P
