\d...Right, right.\d%K%P
「………好好」%K%P
With my heart both resigned and somewhat exasperated, I\nmade a warm smile and entrusted my arms to the two women\nwho meant the world to me.%K%P
这让我既有点惊讶也有点无语…\n然后，我的脸上浮现出发自内心的笑容，\n向我最爱的两个女人，伸出了双手。%K%P
This was the future I'd always wished for.\nThe new life I craved from the bottom of my heart.%K%P
这就是，我所期盼的未来。\n从心底期盼着的、终于实现了的新人生。%K%P
A somewhat weak-willed father... and a husband worrying\nover the thorny relationship between the wife he remarried\nand the girl he brought into the family.%K%P
担心与再婚的妻子关系不好的孩子的将来，\n作为可悲的父亲，以及丈夫。%K%P
From now on, I would keep being the mediator of their\nfights, receiving nothing but joy and heart-melting smiles\nin return.%K%P
从今以后，我也将继续笑呵呵地调停她俩的吵闹，\n并且给予她们持续的笑容。%K%P
